{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021a.q21.material.recovered", "text": "陈老师和王老师在各自班上教学《孙悟空三打白骨精》一课，都提出这样一个问题：“你喜欢文中的谁？为什么？”，有的学生说喜欢孙悟空，有的说喜欢唐僧。出乎意料的是，两个班里都有学生说喜欢白骨精，理由是白骨精为了吃到唐僧肉不怕困难，坚持不懈。 但是，两位老师的处理方式却不同。陈老师的回应是：“你的想法很独特，有创意。”王老师则反问那个学生：“白骨精做的是好事还是坏事？”学生想了想，回答到：“坏事。”王老师接着问：“白骨精不怕困难，坚持不懈做坏事，你也喜欢她吗？”学生红着脸摇了摇头。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "247a392a635dc0112a9c3dc2473d578440b51950362109af05bd0f699a017ceb", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1880, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2118, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 21, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "247a392a635dc0112a9c3dc2473d578440b51950362109af05bd0f699a017ceb"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021a.q21"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m7.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.evaluate"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r044", "ntce.outline.202.r045"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021a.q21"], "word_count": 238, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "247a392a635dc0112a9c3dc2473d578440b51950362109af05bd0f699a017ceb", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1880, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2118, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 21, "a